# Always pull before work

This repository is managed collaboratively. Before any edit, commit, push, deploy, or branch work:

1. `git pull --ff-only` (or equivalent) on the current branch
2. Only then inspect status/diff and make changes

Do not assume the local tree is up to date. Remote commits land frequently; skipping pull causes avoidable conflicts and lost work.
